an&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;972&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1141&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph heading3 ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1142&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1142&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;Quando usar?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1157&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1157&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;A regressão Ridge é particularmente útil em cenários onde os mínimos quadrados apresentam problemas de desempenho:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1271&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1271&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Alta Variância:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1286&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Quando o número de observações (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; font-family: KaTeX_Main, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif; text-rendering: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.4306em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-family: KaTeX_Math; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1320&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;) não é muito maior que o número de variáveis (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; font-family: KaTeX_Main, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif; text-rendering: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-family: KaTeX_Math; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1368&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;), pequenas mudanças nos dados de treinamento podem causar grandes mudanças nas estimativas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1459&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1460&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Muitos Preditores (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; font-family: KaTeX_Main, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif; text-rendering: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.7335em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-family: KaTeX_Math; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mspace&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; margin-right: 0.2778em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mrel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mspace&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; margin-right: 0.2778em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.4306em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-family: KaTeX_Math; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1484&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1486&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Em situações onde há mais variáveis do que observações, os mínimos quadrados não possuem uma solução única, mas a regressão Ridge ainda pode fornecer previsões precisas&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1655&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1656&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Multicolinearidade:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1675&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Quando as variáveis preditoras são altamente correlacionadas, o Ridge ajuda a estabilizar as estimativas dos coeficientes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1797&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1798&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Modelos Densos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1813&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; É preferível ao &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1830&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Lasso&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1835&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; quando a resposta é uma função de muitos preditores, todos com coeficientes de tamanho semelhante&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-size: 23px; font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1933&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph heading3 ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1934&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1934&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph heading3 ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1934&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1934&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;Quais os Benefícios?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1957&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1957&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;Os principais benefícios destacados nas fontes incluem:&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2012&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2012&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Melhoria na Precisão de Teste:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2042&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Ao aceitar um pequeno aumento no &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2076&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;viés&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2080&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;, a regressão Ridge consegue reduzir drasticamente a &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2133&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;variância&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2142&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; do modelo, resultando em um erro quadrático médio (MSE) menor em dados não vistos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2224&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2225&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Estabilidade Estatística:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2250&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; O método produz estimativas mais confiáveis em situações onde o modelo linear padrão seria extremamente instável ou impossível de calcular&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2389&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2390&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Eficiência Computacional:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2415&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; É possível resolver a equação da regressão Ridge simultaneamente para todos os valores de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; font-family: KaTeX_Main, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif; text-rendering: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.6944em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-family: KaTeX_Math; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;λ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2513&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; com um custo computacional quase idêntico ao de um único ajuste de mínimos quadrados&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); font-weight: normal; letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2598&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2599&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2599&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2599&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 23px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2599&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Observação Importante:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2621&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Embora a regressão Ridge encolha os coeficientes, ela &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2676&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;não os define exatamente como zero&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2710&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; (a menos que &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; font-family: KaTeX_Main, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif; text-rendering: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.6944em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-family: KaTeX_Math; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;λ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mspace&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; margin-right: 0.2778em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mrel&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;=&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mspace&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; margin-right: 0.2778em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.4306em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;∞&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2740&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2741&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;. Isso significa que ela não realiza seleção de variáveis automaticamente; para obter modelos mais simples e interpretáveis que excluam variáveis irrelevantes, o método &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2910&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Lasso&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2915&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; costuma ser mais indicado&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-weight: normal;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2941&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=22;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="3090" y="5990" width="1630" height="1220" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
