                <mxCell id="133" value="&lt;h2 style=&quot;scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); text-align: left; box-sizing: inherit; margin: 1.25em 0px -0.28em; line-height: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.016em; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);&quot; data-selectable-paragraph=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;nc nd gm bg ne nf ng nh ni nj nk nl nm nn no np nq nr ns nt nu nv nw nx ny nz bl&quot; id=&quot;ae6f&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit; font-size: 22px; font-weight: normal;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&lt;br class=&quot;Apple-interchange-newline&quot;&gt;Por que a seleção do modelo é importante?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-size: 23px; text-align: left;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-size: 22px;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); letter-spacing: -0.003em; background-color: transparent; box-sizing: inherit;&quot; class=&quot;lx gn&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Aumenta a precisão&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); letter-spacing: -0.003em; background-color: transparent; box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;: Ajuda a identificar o modelo que apresenta melhor desempenho em dados não vistos.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-size: 22px;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); letter-spacing: -0.003em; background-color: transparent; box-sizing: inherit;&quot; class=&quot;lx gn&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Otimiza recursos&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); letter-spacing: -0.003em; background-color: transparent; box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;: economiza tempo e poder computacional ao selecionar o modelo mais adequado.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251);&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); font-size: 22px;&quot; face=&quot;Helvetica&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); letter-spacing: -0.003em; background-color: transparent; box-sizing: inherit;&quot; class=&quot;lx gn&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;Mitiga o sobreajuste ou o subajuste&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); scrollbar-color: rgb(226, 226, 226) rgb(251, 251, 251); letter-spacing: -0.003em; background-color: transparent; box-sizing: inherit; vertical-align: inherit;&quot; dir=&quot;auto&quot;&gt;&amp;nbsp;: Garante que o modelo escolhido se generalize bem para novos dados.&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;" style="rounded=1;whiteSpace=wrap;html=1;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="3080" y="4690" width="1190" height="200" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="134" value="&lt;h2 id=&quot;ae6f&quot; class=&quot;nc nd gm bg ne nf ng nh ni nj nk nl nm nn no np nq nr ns nt nu nv nw nx ny nz bl&quot; data-selectable-paragraph=&quot;&quot; style=&quot;box-sizing: inherit; margin: 1.25em 0px -0.28em; line-height: 30px; letter-spacing: -0.016em; color: rgb(36, 36, 36);&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph heading3 ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;383&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;383&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; font-size: 22px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Regressão Lasso&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;17&quot;&gt; (do inglês &lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;29&quot;&gt;Least Absolute Shrinkage and Selection Operator&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;76&quot;&gt;) é uma técnica de encolhimento e regularização que atua como uma alternativa à regressão Ridge, com o diferencial fundamental de ser capaz de realizar &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;228&quot;&gt;seleção de variáveis&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;button style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 16px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.096px; border-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-radius: 50%; height: 20px; margin-inline-start: 4px; min-width: 20px; cursor: pointer; background-color: rgb(237, 239, 250); color: rgb(27, 27, 28); transition: opacity 0.2s linear; opacity: 1; user-select: none;&quot; data-disabled=&quot;false&quot; aria-describedby=&quot;cdk-describedby-message-ng-1-17&quot; aria-haspopup=&quot;dialog&quot; class=&quot;xap-inline-dialog citation-marker ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;/button&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;button style=&quot;font-style: normal; font-variant: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 16px; font-family: &amp;quot;Google Sans Text&amp;quot;, &amp;quot;Google Sans&amp;quot;, sans-serif; letter-spacing: 0.096px; border-width: 0px; border-style: initial; border-color: initial; border-radius: 50%; height: 20px; margin-inline-start: 4px; min-width: 20px; cursor: pointer; background-color: rgb(237, 239, 250); color: rgb(27