ive; top: -2.55em; margin-left: 0em; margin-right: 0.05em;&quot; class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; overflow: hidden; width: 0px; height: 2.7em;&quot; class=&quot;pstrut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block;&quot; class=&quot;sizing reset-size6 size3 mtight&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; class=&quot;mord mtight&quot;&gt;1&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: table-cell; min-width: 2px; vertical-align: bottom; width: 2px;&quot; class=&quot;vlist-s&quot;&gt;​&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: table-row;&quot; class=&quot;vlist-r&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: table-cell; position: relative; vertical-align: bottom; height: 0.15em;&quot; class=&quot;vlist&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: block; height: 0px; position: relative;&quot; class=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;870&quot;&gt; (que possui &quot;quinas&quot; nos eixos), as curvas de contorno do modelo frequentemente atingem o valor zero para certos coeficientes quando o orçamento de erro é limitado&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1034&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; font-size: 22px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1035&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;• &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1035&quot;&gt;Modelos Esparsos:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1052&quot;&gt; Por excluir variáveis do modelo final, dizemos que o Lasso produz &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1119&quot;&gt;modelos esparsos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1135&quot;&gt;, facilitando a identificação dos preditores mais importantes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1196&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; font-size: 22px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1035&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1035&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;Quando usar o Lasso?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; font-size: 22px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1220&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1220&quot;&gt;A escolha pelo Lasso em vez do Ridge ou de outros métodos depende da natureza dos dados:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; font-size: 22px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1308&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1308&quot;&gt;Sinal Esparso:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1322&quot;&gt; É ideal quando você suspeita que apenas um &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1366&quot;&gt;pequeno subconjunto de preditores&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1399&quot;&gt; tem uma influência real e substancial sobre a resposta&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1454&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1455&quot;&gt;Alta Dimensionalidade (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; font-family: KaTeX_Main, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif; text-rendering: auto;&quot; class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot; class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.7335em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-family: KaTeX_Math; font-style: italic;&quot; class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; margin-right: 0.2778em;&quot; class=&quot;mspace&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; class=&quot;mrel&quot;&gt;&amp;gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; margin-right: 0.2778em;&quot; class=&quot;mspace&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot; class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.4306em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-family: KaTeX_Math; font-style: italic;&quot; class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1483&quot;&gt;):&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1485&quot;&gt; Em cenários onde o número de variáveis é muito grande em relação ao número de observações, o Lasso ajuda a evitar o sobreajuste (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;i class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1615&quot;&gt;overfitting&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1626&quot;&gt;) ao simplificar o modelo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1651&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1652&quot;&gt;Interpretabilidade Requerida:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1681&quot;&gt; Use o Lasso quando o objetivo não é apenas a precisão preditiva, mas também a compreensão de quais variáveis são os principais &quot;motores&quot; do fenômeno estudado&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1839&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; font-size: 22px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1840&quot; class=&quot;paragraph heading3 ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1840&quot; class=&quot;paragraph heading3 ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1840&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;Quais são os Benefícios?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-weight: normal; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1867&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;ul style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1867&quot;&gt;Seleção Automática de Variáveis:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1899&quot;&gt; Diferente de métodos como a seleção &lt;/span&gt;&lt;i style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1936&quot;&gt;stepwise&lt;/i&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1944&quot;&gt;, o Lasso realiza a seleção de forma contínua e automática como parte do ajuste do modelo&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2033&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2034&quot;&gt;Redução da Variância:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2055&quot;&gt; Ao aceitar um pequeno aumento no viés, o Lasso reduz drasticamente a variância do modelo, resultando em previsões mais estáveis e precisas em dados novos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2209&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2210&quot;&gt;Eficiência Computacional:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2235&quot;&gt; Existem algoritmos muito eficientes que permitem calcular todo o &quot;caminho&quot; de soluções (para todos os valores de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; font-family: KaTeX_Main, &amp;quot;Times New Roman&amp;quot;, serif; text-rendering: auto;&quot; class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; text-wrap-mode: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot; class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.6944em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-family: KaTeX_Math; font-style: italic;&quot; class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;λ&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2356&quot;&gt;) com um custo computacional similar ao de um único ajuste de mínimos quadrados&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2435&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2436&quot;&gt;Modelos Mais Simples:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2457&quot;&gt; O resultado final é um modelo com menos termos, o que é mais fácil de comunicar e gerenciar em ambientes de produção&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;color: rgb(63, 63, 63); letter-spacing: -0.016em; background-color: transparent;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2574&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/h2&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;fontSize=22;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="4860" y="5985.92" width="1630" height="1080" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="135" value="" style="shape=image;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=data:image/png,;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="10550" y="970" width="1602.74" height="900" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="136" value="" style="shape=image;imageAspect=0;aspect=fixed;verticalLabelPosition=bottom;verticalAlign=top;image=data:image/png,;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="10550" y="40" width="1602.74" height="900" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="137" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;PCR&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 30px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;0&quot;&gt;A &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2&quot;&gt;Regressão de Componentes Principais (PCR)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;43&quot;&gt; é uma abordagem de redução de dimensionalidade que utiliza a Análise de Componentes Principais (PCA) para resumir um conjunto grande de variáveis preditoras em um conjunto menor de variáveis derivadas, que são então utilizadas em um modelo de regressão linear&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;303&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;304&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;304&quot;&gt;Diferente da regressão logística ou do LDA, o PCR é focado em simplificar a estrutura dos preditores antes de realizar a predição&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;454&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;304&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;font-size: 22px;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;454&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;304&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;font face=&quot;Helvetica&quot; style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;454&quot;&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1374&quot; class=&quot;paragraph heading3 ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1374&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;Quando usar o PCR&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 22px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1391&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1391&quot;&gt;O uso do PCR é recomendado em cenários específicos de modelagem:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 22px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1455&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1455&quot;&gt;Preditores Altamente Correlacionados:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1492&quot;&gt; Quando você possui um grande conjunto de variáveis que estão muito ligadas entre si, o PCR consegue resumir essa informação de forma eficiente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1635&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1636&quot;&gt;Alta Dimensionalidade (&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot; class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot; class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-style: italic;&quot; class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1660&quot;&gt; próximo ou maior que &lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot; class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot; class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.4306em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-style: italic;&quot; class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;b class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1683&quot;&gt;):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1685&quot;&gt; Em situações onde o número de variáveis (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot; class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot; class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-style: italic;&quot; class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1728&quot;&gt;) é grande em relação ao número de observações (&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot; class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot; class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.4306em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-style: italic;&quot; class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1777&quot;&gt;), a regressão linear padrão torna-se instável; o PCR resolve isso reduzindo o número de coeficientes a serem estimados&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1896&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1897&quot;&gt;Premissa de Variação-Resposta:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1927&quot;&gt; Quando se assume que as direções em que os dados mais variam são também as direções associadas à variável de resposta &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot; class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot; class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.6833em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-style: italic; margin-right: 0.2222em;&quot; class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;Y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2047&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 22px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1897&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2047&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2048&quot; class=&quot;paragraph heading3 ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2048&quot;&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;Quais os benefícios do PCR&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 22px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2074&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2074&quot;&gt;As principais vantagens de aplicar esta técnica incluem:&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div style=&quot;font-size: 22px; font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2130&quot; class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2130&quot;&gt;Mitigação do Sobreajuste (Overfitting):&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2169&quot;&gt; Ao estimar apenas &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot; class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot; class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.6833em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-style: italic; margin-right: 0.109em;&quot; class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;M&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2189&quot;&gt; coeficientes em vez de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot; class=&quot;katex&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; class=&quot;katex-html&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot; class=&quot;base&quot;&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;&quot; class=&quot;strut&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-style: italic;&quot; class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot;&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2214&quot;&gt;, o modelo torna-se menos complexo e ganha maior capacidade de generalização para dados novos&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2307&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2308&quot;&gt;Redução da Variância:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2329&quot;&gt; O PCR reduz significativamente a variância das estimativas dos coeficientes, o que é crucial em problemas onde os dados de treinamento são limitados&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2478&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2479&quot;&gt;Visualização e Exploração:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2505&quot;&gt; Como as primeiras componentes capturam a maior parte da informação, elas permitem visualizar dados complexos de muitas dimensões em apenas duas ou três dimensões&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span style=&quot;&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2667&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/div&gt;" style="text;html=1;align=left;verticalAlign=top;whiteSpace=wrap;rounded=0;" parent="1" vertex="1">
                    <mxGeometry x="10580" y="1960" width="1560" height="870" as="geometry"/>
                </mxCell>
                <mxCell id="138" value="&lt;h3 style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;PLS&lt;/h3&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;0&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;0&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;O &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;2&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Partial Least Squares (PLS)&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;29&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; é um método de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;45&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;redução de dimensionalidade&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;72&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; supervisionado que funciona como uma alternativa à Regressão de Componentes Principais (PCR)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;165&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;. Enquanto o PCR identifica direções que explicam apenas a variação dos preditores, o PLS utiliza a variável de resposta &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.6833em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-style: italic; margin-right: 0.2222em;&quot;&gt;Y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;287&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; para identificar novas variáveis que não apenas resumem os preditores, mas também são diretamente relacionadas à resposta&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;409&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;409&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;409&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;409&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph heading3 ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1397&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;1397&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;Quando usar o PLS?&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1415&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;1415&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Alta Dimensionalidade:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1437&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Quando o número de preditores &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.625em; vertical-align: -0.1944em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;p&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1469&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; é grande, possivelmente maior que o número de observações &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.4306em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-style: italic;&quot;&gt;n&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1529&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;1530&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Preditores Correlacionados:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1557&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Em cenários onde as variáveis de entrada são altamente ligadas entre si, o PLS consegue resumir essa informação de forma eficiente&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1688&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;1689&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Áreas Específicas:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1707&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; O método é particularmente popular no campo da &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;1755&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;quimiometria&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1767&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;, onde muitas variáveis surgem de sinais de espectrometria digitais&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1834&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph heading3 ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1835&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;1835&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph heading3 ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1835&quot; role=&quot;heading&quot; aria-level=&quot;3&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;1835&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;font style=&quot;font-size: 26px;&quot;&gt;Principais Benefícios e Limitações&lt;/font&gt;&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;1869&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;ul&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;1869&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Abordagem Supervisionada:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;1894&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Diferente do PCR, o PLS garante que a relação com a resposta seja considerada desde o início da criação dos novos componentes&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2020&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;2021&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Redução de Viés:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2037&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; A natureza supervisionada pode reduzir o viés em comparação com métodos puramente não supervisionados&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2139&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;2140&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Equilíbrio:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2151&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; O método tenta encontrar direções que ajudem a explicar tanto a resposta quanto os preditores&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2245&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;li&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;2246&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Ressalva Estatística:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2267&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Na prática, o benefício de reduzir o viés pode ser anulado por um aumento na &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;2345&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;variância&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2354&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;, o que muitas vezes faz com que o desempenho do PLS seja similar ao da regressão Ridge ou do PCR&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2451&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/li&gt;&lt;/ul&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2452&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2452&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2452&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2452&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;br&gt;--------------------------------------------------------------------------------&lt;br&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2534&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;2534&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;Comparação Rápida:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2552&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;• &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;2552&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;PCR:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2556&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Cria componentes baseados apenas na variabilidade de &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.6833em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-style: italic; margin-right: 0.0785em;&quot;&gt;X&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2611&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; (não olha para &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.6833em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-style: italic; margin-right: 0.2222em;&quot;&gt;Y&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2628&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;)&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2629&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;.&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/div&gt;&lt;div class=&quot;paragraph normal ng-star-inserted&quot; data-start-index=&quot;2630&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.5rem; margin-block-end: 0.75rem;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;• &lt;/span&gt;&lt;b data-start-index=&quot;2630&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;PLS:&lt;/b&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2634&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; Cria componentes baseados na relação entre &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-content; display: inline-block;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;strut&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; display: inline-block; height: 0.6833em;&quot;&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;mord mathnormal&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; font-style: italic; margin-right: 0.0785em;&quot;&gt;X&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/span&gt;&lt;span data-start-index=&quot;2679&quot; class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt; e &lt;/span&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;ng-star-inserted&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex&quot; style=&quot;font-variant-numeric: normal; font-variant-east-asian: normal; font-variant-alternates: normal; font-size-adjust: none; font-kerning: auto; font-optical-sizing: auto; font-feature-settings: normal; font-variation-settings: normal; font-variant-position: normal; font-variant-emoji: normal; font-stretch: normal; line-height: 1.2; text-rendering: auto;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;katex-html&quot; aria-hidden=&quot;true&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor;&quot;&gt;&lt;span class=&quot;base&quot; style=&quot;border-color: currentcolor; position: relative; white-space: nowrap; width: min-con